#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:7
#: 151e78dc88e04d6db63fc37b4418427c
msgid ""
"Pixhawk6X®  is the latest update to the successful family of Pixhawk® "
"autopilots made by Holybro, featuring STM32H7 cpus, vibration isolation of "
"IMUs, redundant IMUs, double redundant barometers on separate buses, IMU "
"heating, and integrated Ethernet for high speed connections to companion "
"computers."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk6X® 是 Holybro 生产的 Pixhawk® 飞控系列的最新版本，搭载 STM32H7 处理器，具备 IMU 隔振、冗余 "
"IMU、分布在独立总线上的双冗余气压计、IMU 加热以及集成以太网，可实现与伴飞计算机的高速连接。"

