#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:56
#: ec0d23b7c4bd45aea8392958bcef096b
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:57
#: e1901687b4ac442c875ecb932d8ff4f7
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这两种协议需要真正的"
" UART 连接）。但 FPort 以此方式连接时，仅提供 RC 而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:59
#: 004c9199ce6340e0b1d6afeb68b88a8d
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL6 (UART4) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using Serial6."
msgstr ""
"为支持 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的嵌入式数传，需使用完整 UART（如 SERIAL6（UART4））进行接收机连接。以下为使用 "
"Serial6 的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:61
#: 0be7b6853467451dbdf72664c0aa7c3e
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为 「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:63
#: 261c1af604e74f21b9f69c948a9e09a5
msgid ""
"FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to "
"\"15\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:65
#: 918c68e9ed8f4d2aac63f5e915a2367b
msgid ""
"CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"0\"."
msgstr "CRSF 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:67
#: 64a7dfeeb7e94e668c6792a34bb8277e
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" "
"and connects only the TX pin."
msgstr "SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」，并仅连接 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:69
#: ea026cd2ab2f426eb41085ea5bb07841
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:72
#: 5e9c191512704a4aa5f6e66a3a4eafef
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:74
#: a7686bb2ec5f405186901bac839cb9fb
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk6X supports up to 16 PWM outputs. All 16 outputs support all "
"normal PWM output formats. All FMU outputs, except 7 and 8, also support "
"DShot."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk6X 最多支持 16 路 PWM 输出。所有 16 路输出均支持普通 PWM 输出格式。除第 7 和第 8 路外，所有 FMU 输出均支持"
" DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:77
#: 6243e7e434b143a68de6bc3dc70de3b6
msgid "The 8 FMU PWM outputs are in 4 groups:"
msgstr "8 路 FMU PWM 输出分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:79
#: cd73abd2793c42c18ec5f223d458d398
msgid "Outputs 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr "输出 1、2、3 和 4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:80
#: 5c38760d8c9f4b03b423b158f7855ad2
msgid "Outputs 5 and 6 in group2"
msgstr "输出 5 和 6 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:81
#: 78bcb1d2a29a41f8b3a844683d069a77
msgid "Outputs 7 and 8 in group3"
msgstr "输出 7 和 8 在第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:84
#: ef9f933b6c974517a5b84fe9e8ed78f4
msgid ""
"FMU outputs within the same group need to use the same output rate and "
"protocol. If any output in a group uses DShot then all channels in that "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的 FMU 输出需使用相同的输出频率和协议。若某组内任一输出使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:89
#: 6c2cb22853634efc8de4f18d7f3b9c20
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:91
#: 95dab4acd05547169aeea425eb05995c
msgid ""
"The board has 2 dedicated power monitor ports with a 6 pin connector. They "
"are intended for use with the I2C power monitor supplied with the autopilot."
msgstr "该板有 2 个专用的 6 针电源监测端口，配合飞控随附的 I2C 电源监测器使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:94
#: 5a0eca74c0c441b4b308c168e8360f5f
msgid ""
"do not try to use the Mission Planner SETUP->Optional Hardware->Battery "
"Monitor tab to setup the I2C power monitors for the Pixhawk6X. The "
"parameters needed for their operation are already setup by default:"
msgstr ""
"请勿尝试通过 Mission Planner 的 SETUP->Optional Hardware->Battery Monitor 选项卡来为 "
"Pixhawk6X 设置 I2C 电源监测器。这些参数已默认预设："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:96
#: dd22ee6aed384ca5a06bb8c4938e8dce
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 21"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 21"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:97
#: e43ada165ed649e2b7477be31901b54d
msgid ":ref:`BATT_I2C_BUS<BATT_I2C_BUS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_I2C_BUS<BATT_I2C_BUS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:98
#: 58fe30bb97bc43668ee0c93025d19996
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_I2C_ADDR<BATT_I2C_ADDR__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>` = 65 (For Low "
"voltage (6S) Digital Power Module),= 69 (For High Voltage (12S/14S) Digital "
"Power Module)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_I2C_ADDR<BATT_I2C_ADDR__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>` = "
"65（适用于低压（6S）数字电源模块），= 69（适用于高压（12S/14S）数字电源模块）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:100
#: a7a59daf57744c4d92cb5b00f733c4be
msgid ""
"In Ardupilot 4.4 and later, the BATT_I2C_ADDR for Pixhawk 6X is default to "
"be 0. This will perform an auto detection of the I2C address, and you do not"
" need to change BATT_I2C_ADDR parameter."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 4.4 及更高版本中，Pixhawk 6X 的 BATT_I2C_ADDR 默认为 0，将自动检测 I2C 地址，无需更改 "
"BATT_I2C_ADDR 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:103
#: b81463a20ea14ca084ddc8c5a4b9121f
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6X.rst:105
#: 3e9bba8443d941d39fcb59313377e67a
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk6X has a built-in compass. Due to potential interference, the "
"autopilot is usually used with an external I2C compass as part of a "
"GPS/Compass combination."
msgstr "Pixhawk6X 内置罗盘。由于可能存在干扰，飞控通常与 GPS/罗盘组合中的外部 I2C 罗盘配合使用。"

